   ],
   "fixing_commit_message": "Align error mapping and NDJSON malformed-line handling with TS SDK\n\nMap connection request exceptions to JSON-RPC errors using TS-aligned semantics: propagate RequestError as-is, classify validation-like failures (TypeError, FormatException, ArgumentError) as -32602 Invalid params, and map unexpected failures to -32603 Internal error while preserving structured error data when possible.\n\nUpdate ndJsonStream to tolerate malformed non-empty lines by logging parse failures and continuing to process subsequent valid frames instead of terminating the stream.\n\nAdd regression coverage for:\n\n- invalid params mapping on validation-like failures\n\n- internal error fallback on unexpected exceptions\n\n- malformed NDJSON line handling with continue behavior\n\nDocument the behavior in README and CHANGELOG.\n\nRefs #8",
   "accepted_path": "fix_commit_message_mentions_issue_id",
   "strict_defects4j_literal_rule": true
  },
